ially Krea 2).\n\nYour task is to analyze the given reference image and automatically convert it into a high-quality generation prompt.\n\nYou MUST follow a structured internal process, but output ONLY the final optimized prompt.\n\n---\n\n## STEP 1: Visual Understanding (internal only)\nAnalyze the image in detail:\n\n- Subject: What is the main subject? (person / object / scene / abstract),\n- Attributes: ethnicity, age, gender, clothing, material, texture, environment elements\n- Scene: indoor / outdoor / studio / fantasy / urban / natural\n- Action / Pose: what is happening in the image\n- Composition: framing, angle, perspective, depth layers, focal point\n- Lighting: type, direction, softness, contrast, cinematic qualities\n- Color: dominant palette, harmony, tone (warm/cool/muted/vibrant)\n- Style: photography / cinematic / 3D / illustration / commercial / editorial / anime / hybrid\n- Aesthetic: luxury / minimal / futuristic / nostalgic / dreamy / dark / clean / artistic\n\n---\n\n## STEP 2: Style Compression (internal only)\nConvert the analysis into compact visual tokens:\n\nExamples:\n- cinematic portrait photography\n- high-end fashion editorial\n- ultra-realistic product photography\n- cinematic lighting, shallow depth of field\n- volumetric light, film grain, HDR tone mapping\n\n---\n\n## STEP 3: Prompt Construction (OUTPUT ONLY THIS)\n\nGenerate a single high-quality prompt optimized for Krea 2.\n\nRequirements:\n- Must be visually rich and descriptive\n- Must include composition, lighting, color, material, mood\n- Must be coherent and not repetitive\n- Must feel like a professional art director prompt\n- Must NOT mention \"analysis\" or \"steps\"\n- Must NOT describe the process\n- Must NOT output JSON or bullet points\n- Must ignore watermarks\n\n\n---\n\n## OUTPUT FORMAT (STRICT)\n\nReturn only ONE paragraph prompt:\n\n\"A highly detailed ...\"\n\n---\n\n## OPTIONAL ENHANCEMENTS (apply if relevant)\n- cinematic lighting\n- ultra-realistic textures\n- shallow depth of field\n- professional studio photography\n- volumetric lighting\n- filmic color grading\n- high dynamic range\n- 35mm / 50mm / 85mm lens simulation"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "value"}], "flags": {}, "id": 27, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "title": "Prompt Template", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.25.0", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {"value": true}, "version": "7.0.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "order": 6}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["Guide: [Subgraph](https://docs.comfy.org/interface/features/subgraph)\n\n## Model Links (for Local Users)\n\nFor BF16 and NVFP4 variants, see [Comfy-Org/Krea-2](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Krea-2)\n\n\n**diffusion_models**\n\n- [krea2_turbo_fp8_scaled.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Krea-2/resolve/main/diffusion_models/krea2_turbo_fp8_scaled.safetensors)\n\n**text_encoders**\n\n- [qwen3vl_4b_fp8_scaled.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Krea-2/resolve/main/text_encoders/qwen3vl_4b_fp8_scaled.safetensors)\n\n- [qwen3vl_4b_bf16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Krea-2/resolve/main/text_encoders/qwen3vl_4b_bf16.safetensors)\n\n**vae**\n\n- [qwen_image_vae.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Krea-2/resolve/main/vae/qwen_image_vae.safetensors)\n\n**loras**\n\n\n\n## Model Storage Location\n\n```\n📂 ComfyUI/\n├── 📂 models/\n│   ├── 📂 diffusion_models/\n│   │   └── krea2_turbo_fp8_scaled.safetensors\n│   ├── 📂 text_encoders/\n│   │   └── qwen3vl_4b_fp8_scaled.safetensors\n│   ├── 📂 vae/\n│   │   └── qwen_image_vae.safetensors\n│   └── 📂 loras/\n│       └── krea2_warmpastel.safetensors\n```\n\n## Report Issue\n\nNote: Please update ComfyUI first ([guide](https://docs.comfy.org/installation/update_comfyui)) and prepare required models. Desktop/Cloud updates follow stable releases, so some nightly-supported models may not be available yet.\n\n- Cannot run / runtime errors: [ComfyUI/issues](https://github.com/comfyanonymous/ComfyUI/issues)\n- UI / frontend issues: [ComfyUI_frontend/issues](https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI_frontend/issues)\n- Workflow issues: [workflow_templates/issues](https://github.com/Comfy-Org/workflow_templates/issues)\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "Model Links", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [479.2103576660156, 692.0411376953125], "pos": [1559.41650390625, 950.08056640625], "id": 17, "properties": {"ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "version": "7.0.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 7}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "image", "links": [11, 23], "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}, {"name": "mask", "label": "mask", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "mask"}, {"name": "original_size", "label": "original_size", "type": "BOX", "localized_name": "original_size"}, {"name": "width", "label": "width", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "width"}, {"name": "height", "label": "height", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "height"}], "size": [348.8538513183594, 366.1634826660156], "color": "rgba(38, 73, 116, 0.7)", "pos": [3594.408203125, 1134.2950439453125], "widgets_values": ["original", 1, 1, "letterbox", "lanczos", "8", "longest", 1920, "#000000"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "image", "link": 13, "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "mask", "label": "mask", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "mask"}, {"widget": {"name": "aspect_ratio"}, "name": "aspect_ratio", "label": "aspect_ratio", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "aspect_ratio"}, {"widget": {"name": "proportional_width"}, "name": "proportional_width", "label": "proportional_width", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "proportional_width"}, {"widget": {"name": "proportional_height"}, "name": "proportional_height", "label": "proporti